  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.2x&amp;supported_versions=1.18x,1.19x,1.20x,1.21x,26.1x&amp;total_versions=1.17x,1.18x,1.19x,1.20x,1.21x,26.1x,26.2x&amp;progress_bar=false&amp;mc_background=false&amp;icons=true&amp;platform=curseforge\" alt=\"支持的Minecraft版本\"></p><blockquote>\n  <p>26.2.x版本的支持正在开发中！</p>\n</blockquote><p><strong>Forge</strong> 仅支持至 Minecraft 1.21.5。</p><h2>🫧 功能</h2><p>这款客户端模组让气泡粒子破灭，并彻底改变了它们的行为，使其更真实地上升到水面。此外，还为水下开启的箱子、木桶和爆炸增加了气泡粒子效果。</p><p>修复了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbugs.mojang.com%252fbrowse%252fMC-132067\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MC-132067</a> 漏洞。</p><h2>📺 演示视频</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">➜ 演示视频可在 Modrinth 上查看</a></p><h2>🔧 安装</h2><p>选择您的模组加载器</p><p><a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"make-bubbles-pop/files?gameVersionTypeId=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a></p><p>legacy.curseforge 的链接：</p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a> <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/make-bubbles-pop/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact-minimal/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Quilt\"></a></p><p><strong>NeoForge</strong> 目前不提供原生支持，但您可以在 NeoForge 上安装 Fabric 版本的 Make Bubbles Pop，前提是同时安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a>。</p><p>下载最新版本，将 <code>.jar</code> 文件放入 Minecraft 目录中的 <code>mods</code> 文件夹。</p><p>要配置 Make Bubbles Pop，请额外安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/midnightlib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MidnightLib</a>（针对 Fabric）或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a>（针对 Forge）。</p><p>目前不建议将 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particle-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particle Tweaks</a> 与 Make Bubbles Pop 一起安装。</p><h2>🗺️ 计划中的功能</h2><ul>\n<li>原生 NeoForge 支持</li>\n</ul><h2>🔗 外部链接</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmake_bubbles_pop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/452c07c3fc13361faa37e90d1262e4f7/raw/668cdb7776499728664beca45bd00227146f2b3f/modrinth-dark.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmod%252fmake-bubbles-pop-fabric%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-32.png\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftschipcraft.ddns.net%252fen%252fmake_bubbles_pop.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/7c6a2b28406185befdd8607b4a852f44/raw/005992426dd478c6cf941f8680046b7516fe6c9c/website_logo_curse.svg\" alt=\"网站\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C5HEJB2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"在 ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></p><h2>🤝 合作伙伴优惠</h2><p>想要购买 <strong>Hytale</strong> 或升级您的版本？在结账时使用创作者代码 <code>Tschipcraft</code>，我将获得佣金！（您的价格保持不变）</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/partner/sparked_banner.png\" alt=\"通过获取 Sparked Host 服务器来支持我（这是联盟链接）\"></a></p>",
